@startuml
!include <archimate/Archimate>
skinparam linetype ortho
'left to right direction
title TOGAF Layered View - Ecommerce Platform

' ---------- Styles ----------
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 10
  Shadowing false
}
legend right
  |= Слой |= Цвет |
  | Business | #FFF2CC |
  | Application | #D9E1F2 |
  | Data | #E2F0D9 |
  | Technology | #FCE4D6 |
endlegend

' ---------- Business ----------
archimate #FFF2CC "Покупатель" as Customer <<business-actor>>
archimate #FFF2CC "Администратор/Ведущий" as Admin <<business-actor>>
archimate #FFF2CC "Управление заказами" as BP_Order <<business-process>>
archimate #FFF2CC "Демонстрация cookies" as BP_Cookie <<business-process>>
archimate #FFF2CC "Демонстрация API" as BP_API <<business-process>>

' ---------- Application ----------
archimate #D9E1F2 "Frontend (React)" as APP_FE <<application-component>>
archimate #D9E1F2 "Backend API (FastAPI)" as APP_BE <<application-component>>
archimate #D9E1F2 "Order API Service" as SVC_Order <<application-service>>
archimate #D9E1F2 "Cookie API Service" as SVC_Cookie <<application-service>>
archimate #D9E1F2 "Docs UI (/docs,/redoc)" as APP_Docs <<application-component>>

' ---------- Data ----------
archimate #E2F0D9 "Order DTO" as D_OrderDTO <<data-object>>
archimate #E2F0D9 "OpenAPI YAML" as D_OAS <<data-object>>
archimate #E2F0D9 "Order / Payment / Customer" as D_Domain <<business-object>>

' ---------- Technology ----------
archimate #FCE4D6 "Caddy" as T_Caddy <<node>>
archimate #FCE4D6 "Frontend container" as T_FE <<node>>
archimate #FCE4D6 "Backend container" as T_BE <<node>>
archimate #FCE4D6 "PostgreSQL" as T_DB <<node>>

Customer --> BP_Order
Admin --> BP_Cookie
Admin --> BP_API

BP_Order --> SVC_Order : поддерживается
BP_Cookie --> SVC_Cookie : поддерживается
BP_API ---> APP_Docs : поддерживается

APP_FE --> SVC_Order : HTTP/JSON
APP_BE --> SVC_Order : реализует
APP_BE --> SVC_Cookie : реализует
APP_Docs --> D_OAS : читает

SVC_Order --> D_OrderDTO
SVC_Order --> D_Domain
SVC_Cookie --> D_Domain

T_Caddy --> T_FE
T_Caddy --> T_BE
APP_FE --> T_FE : deploy
APP_BE --> T_BE : deploy
SVC_Order --> T_DB : SQL
SVC_Cookie --> T_DB : SQL(косвенно)

@enduml